Subject: [PATCH] wireless: include linux/hex.h for mac_pton on Linux 7.3

Linux 7.3 no longer pulls <linux/hex.h> transitively via core headers
in net/wireless/sysfs.c, which uses hex_to_bin() via mac_pton().

--- a/net/wireless/sysfs.c
+++ b/net/wireless/sysfs.c
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
  */
 
 #include <linux/device.h>
+#include <linux/hex.h>
 #include <linux/module.h>
 #include <linux/netdevice.h>
 #include <linux/nl80211.h>
